WEBVTT

00:00:05.668 --> 00:00:07.008
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> What’s the date today?

00:00:17.412 --> 00:00:18.472
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Are you sure?

00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:29.937
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Isn’t it the 1st?

00:00:40.245 --> 00:00:41.949
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> It’s my dad’s birthday.

00:00:52.024 --> 00:00:53.572
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> This is for you.

00:01:03.810 --> 00:01:04.851
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Happy Birthday!

00:01:14.857 --> 00:01:17.661
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Is that Jennifer Zielinski?

00:01:27.869 --> 00:01:29.075
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Yes. Who’s that?

00:01:39.236 --> 00:01:41.702
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> We need to talk about your trip to London.

00:01:51.581 --> 00:01:52.468
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Of course!

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:05.122
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Call me on Monday at work.

00:02:15.447 --> 00:02:17.000
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Talk to you on Tuesday.